{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14301341","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14301341","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1430134101:0":{"text":"응, 프리다네 칠면조야. 프리다 가족이 마을을 떠나서 멀리 일하러 갔거든.","source_cn":"这是弗瑞达家的火鸡，弗瑞达一家都离开村子，去外面闯荡了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79FCC606DE6C386D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1430134102:0":{"text":"프리다가 편지를 보냈는데, 그쪽 대장간 일이 꽤 잘 된대!","source_cn":"最近弗瑞达给我写信，他们在外面的铁匠铺生意挺好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB5B9BE98C86FDE4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1430134103:0":{"text":"프리다가 돌아올 때까지는 내가 잘 돌봐줘야지.","source_cn":"弗瑞达回来以前，我要替她照顾好这些火鸡……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A6583814124B724","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:矮人布斯丽":{"text":"드워프 부슬리","source":"矮人布斯丽","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}